    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p>For the one who knows Pioneerz from Xbox360, it's the same game.\r\nBut with improvmeent : 16/9, bigger map and difficulty, pad and keyboard support, improved gameplay...</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Live the life of a fantasy pioneer: Help your town to grow by protecting it and gathering resource. Explore the world, fight monsters and enemy towns.\r\nBut be careful, the world is living (Plants grow, animals reproduce, towns are expanding\u2026)\r\nAnd you never know which danger you will encounter (rabbit invasion, wandering trolls, underground scar\u2026)\r\n\r\nThe road is harsh to make a peaceful empire!\r\n\r\nNb : Multiplayer needs at least a pad.",
